cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GP-SR-MINCO: Global Proposal and Shared Local Refinement for Single-Frame LiDAR Local Planning"
abstract: >-
  A learning-based local planner for quadrotors that predicts a smooth two-second trajectory from a single 360-degree
  LiDAR scan and the current motion state in one forward pass.
authors:
  - family-names: Zheng
    given-names: Yipin
